# MBAX 6418 class-service configuration — copy this file to `.env` and fill in
# the API key. The key is the SAME for all class services. NEVER commit `.env`
# and never paste the key into logs, screenshots, errors, or docs.
#
# Base URLs follow the supplied class-endpoints.txt handout (2026/09/30).
# Ports 9006-9008 are new for this assignment: confirm the exact URL shape
# (/v1 suffix and request format) from the handout before coding issues #2-#4.

